{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:00 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"洪永城兩歲半細女學體操超有天份  輕鬆「一字馬」軟骨功驚艷教練  遺傳梁諾妍運動基因\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/869d0fd934773a138d795b1b46e84e63/2026-10/KF_47.jpg\"/>\n<p>洪永城（Tony）與太太梁諾妍（Inez）育有兩位千金，細女「Sir Nose」洪靖愉（Beryl）盡得媽媽運動員的優良基因。梁諾妍昨日（18日）在社交平台分享囡囡上體操堂的片段，年紀小小、精靈可愛的 Beryl 展現出驚人的身體柔軟度，萌爆一眾網民。</p>\n<h2>洪永城細女Beryl展現超強柔軟度</h2>\n<p>從梁諾妍分享的短片及照片可見，身穿粉紅色運動服、紮起孖辮的 Beryl 在體操墊上做熱身和拉筋時表現得有板有眼。其中一個動作需要雙腿張開呈「一字馬」坐姿，Beryl 不僅輕鬆完成，更能輕易將上半身完全前壓，腹部緊貼地面，展現出驚人柔軟度，連在場教練亦忍不住拍手讚好。</p>\n<p>在另一段短片中，Beryl 在教練協助下練習單槓動作。只見她先以圓滾滾的小肚腩頂住單槓，隨即順勢翻身，動作俐落流暢，全程毫不怯場。除了拉筋與單槓練習，Beryl 還跟隨音樂節奏擺動身體、練習平衡與彈跳，全程掛著招牌燦爛笑容，十分享受體操課的樂趣。</p>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍與洪永城於2021年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c223318a829421196c00e46c52123d69/2023-03/ienz_ig_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城太太梁諾妍帶一對女兒去做運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e77132638b28f972739aef89aa0f743/2026-10/hung_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城細女Beryl越大越可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/276d696b0a9bf17d2af33ea7e043f1a6/2026-10/hung_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍分享細女Beryl學體操得影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fb1d499397cb58b438b05b2f8e81972/2026-10/hung_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城細女Beryl身體好柔軟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e5429ff3ed8ec4c3771f41cee2c093a/2026-10/hung_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城細女Beryl跟住教練學習。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb25ae633acee5634bd097fee8463fe5/2026-10/hung_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl雖然只有兩歲半，但對外籍教練的指令都非常理解。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecb97da4e9ee7008b207ec7cbb2b0ad9/2026-10/hung_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl跟住音樂做伸展運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c2f165fe5b0ce78d2617e92088a727d/2026-10/hung_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl 蹲低好靈活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23c128ea6f12285a130ab33477cae21c/2026-10/hung_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl拉筋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcb945a46f95df23defada95c8e79cac/2026-10/hung_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl 踢腳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0388e570880c1bd141a3afd5392bd7e0/2026-10/hung_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女Beryl做一字馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de9c177e4ed778afde3019155e319958/2026-10/hung_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城細女Beryl每個動作都做得好標準。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7269cfb76bc3ea84aea2e2a97e99aa73/2026-10/hung_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女Beryl 的筋骨好柔軟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a82f0e02cd6ac9bfb824498329ab6fb3/2026-10/hung_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl 在教練的協助下練習單槓動作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e11cf06d5535d454ac2441ef24a4b6cf/2026-10/hung_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"見到洪永城細女先用小肚腩頂住單槓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/671bc7e6c83cd84dbdb59165b1133e15/2026-10/hung_36_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城細女Beryl順勢翻身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60ff945320b6af6af13f44077a0f7680/2026-10/hung_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl動作流暢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddfa49643279c47572a1fc738716e0d6/2026-10/hung_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl展現好臂力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6fa3c5a79c5da1dfc0519c7dfbd0838/2026-10/hung_41_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl在單槓上動作靈活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0102ca811533aeb97cc87236e1382e6/2026-10/hung_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl在教練的幫助下，在單槓上活動自如。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72b7bebcaafc0e298dffe8069805cb50/2026-10/hung_47_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl每個動作都有板有眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da732fa27a0b8f246abec71a8936d753/2026-10/hung_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Beryl跳得好高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a6ba4233853d7b80a69fa6b0188da6a/2026-10/hung_50_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>Beryl完美遺傳媽媽運動細胞</h2>\n<p>看見愛女的精靈表現，媽媽梁諾妍亦忍不住發文笑稱：「徇眾要求！體操妹太可愛，出個post俾佛妹（Beryl）粉治癒下。佛妹用個肚腩仔頂住支bar真係好醒目，小朋友做體操實在太可愛！」短片曝光後吸引大批網民留言讚好，紛紛大讚 Beryl 萌態十足，更完美繼承了媽媽的運動細胞，絕對是潛力十足的「體操界明日之星」。</p>\n<img alt=\"洪永城與太太婚後好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7ef04b819fcf70c6af8d544a54c5785/2025-12/inez_leong_1765036594_3781723505441284791_4860859_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城2021年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a9531651e444a5736b8f9c6586caef7/2023-12/inez_leong_1701865493_3251805906597805165_4860859.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城一家四口享受平淡是福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c95ec2a171ca21ce564e3b9af2a3d3e/2025-12/HUNG002_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城與梁諾妍育有兩女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d1acf7e3833bddc14d56f81bf41e5aa/2024-03/Inez_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍2024年3月中在IG上載多張細女照片報喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3549098947cf78fa155af919683a5f5/2024-03/inez_leong_1711184069_3329975782973175204_4860859.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城再添一女非常高興，將細女緊抱在懷中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d1098177ddd33237275c8c6284e183e/2024-03/inez_leong_1711184069_3329975782973275313_4860859.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍一人照顧兩女一狗，非常厲害。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbd87675b2dabdffa04a688f865c5472/2025-01/HUNG_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當時只有3歲的Sir Face爬樹唔怕跌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5825fcaa529c75a9ba2959a3f04c970a/2025-01/HUNG_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face小時候好似爸爸洪永城。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16dff441c52d6aec6252632dc8ed8f9c/2024-12/SIRFACE_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍與洪永城帶女兒到主題樂園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e75158c124b78b5c01dbc261e78047d3/2025-04/inez_leong_1742635525_3593809723872551118_4860859.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face生日洪永城一家四口慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df931534759b4c58ade467016fcc7498/2024-12/SIRFACE_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face錫錫妹妹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88d91050cda600950331b11e3089eef1/2024-12/SIRFACE_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f918e647150728deba0253c7b00715c9/2024-12/SIRFACE_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face自得其樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53048dc93aacf119e009d1baa31cb7e1/2024-12/SIRFACE_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face玩到伸脷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/397924a766ba6a6cfadfc42fa8361779/2024-12/SIRFACE_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城Sir Face的造型好可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/627402434dcbf80df7c5ed12f68d0509/2024-12/SIRFACE_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪永城的細女Beryl啜住兩個奶嘴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e97a413f2a545daa71a1c413f184e458/2025-11/inez_leong_1763660152_4860859.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍與「Sir Nose」齊齊做親子運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54a262c7df4da278a2deb2b9c0654ecf/2024-08/VS----0_19__4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍的細女好快已可以企起身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da7d2fead53b8a5b70678a6fbaa93ead/2025-01/HUNG_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍照顧細女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2ed308e051a183ade855e4c92ca5c00/2025-01/HUNG_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍在IG貼出兩個囡囡的初生BB相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/748d116e3f7110686340a21e2fe657d3/2024-06/448971096_18437170969060860_3138540456400543812_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"左邊是Sir Face，右邊是阿妹Beryl。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02c5c745471f973bf7a23835fafd9b24/2024-06/449048912_18437170987060860_152665581753324885_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face好似洪永城，妹妹較為似梁諾妍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9036aeb8bf71c42d97b4679a4194cb02/2024-06/448766526_18437170996060860_3320500929843980066_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sir Face好似洪永城，妹妹較為似梁諾妍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9ce8d36e443cb46b06d7d26f92c9d49/2024-06/449009904_18437171005060860_8978611884030536175_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"抱着細女的洪永城一臉慈父模樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de2d787e019ce62188761011c07799b3/2024-06/447286732_1111480540149197_3113668024584239413_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女Beryl（下）與洪永城童年猶如倒模，力證洪氏基因強大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6482c5a916a45094367e4bfe0c3570b2/2024-05/HUNG_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女Beryl（下）與洪永城童年猶如倒模，力證洪氏基因強大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01abbc254412ef3f4e2cf2013110b6b0/2024-05/HUNG_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁諾妍笑言：「Amber係100%似晒大個咗嘅Tony樣，而Beryl，係由Tony細個開始就100%嘅樣扱出嚟，以上嘅分析同結果係一啲阿媽嘅份都冇。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/091e69115702c878a7b3ad12fcbde702/2024-05/HUNG_06.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:22:18.780726+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":599,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:57:57.512557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:17.462563+00:00","content_hash":"601291a14ff348cc3e2c6c095b4d79a949fa746d98b8d67d67e1c1c225d804cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}